@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 14
  BorderThickness 1.2
}
skinparam component {
  BorderThickness 1.2
}
skinparam database {
  BorderColor #64748B
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}
skinparam activity {
  BorderColor #64748B
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  DiamondBorderColor #F97316
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF7ED
}
skinparam partition {
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}
skinparam note {
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

actor "学生/教师" as User
participant "学生学习空间/教师看板" as UI
participant "诊断智能体" as D
participant "学生数字孪生" as S
participant "课程数字孪生" as C
participant "个性化路径" as P
participant "教师智能干预" as I

User -> UI : 请求诊断或查看风险
UI -> D : diagnosis_request(student, scope)
D -> S : 读取画像、掌握度、实践能力、风险信号
S --> D : 学生证据摘要
D -> C : 读取课程图谱、资源、测评、能力映射
C --> D : 课程上下文
D -> D : 证据分级与原因解释
D --> UI : 分端诊断结论
D -> P : 薄弱点与补学建议
D -> I : 明确风险与建议动作
I --> UI : 任务包草稿待教师审核
@enduml
